Subject: [PATCH] CLI: serve pinned browser dependencies from the appliance

CDN failures otherwise leave topology rendering with d3 undefined. The recipe
installs the versioned vendor archive, including fonts and upstream licenses.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [offline laboratory appliance]

--- a/src/rdkb-cli/static/index.html
+++ b/src/rdkb-cli/static/index.html
@@ -31,8 +31,8 @@
-    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
-    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/animate.css/4.1.1/animate.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
+    <link href="static/vendor/fontawesome/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
+    <link href="static/vendor/animate-4.1.1.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
     <!-- Added Chart.js library -->
-    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/3.9.1/chart.min.js"></script>
-    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/d3@7/dist/d3.min.js"></script>
+    <script src="static/vendor/chart-3.9.1.min.js"></script>
+    <script src="static/vendor/d3-7.9.0.min.js"></script>
 </head>
 <body>
     <div class="app-container">
